# Root .dockerignore - needed because dashboard/Dockerfile is the one
# service in this repo whose build context is the repo root (it needs to
# COPY docs/ and README.md, which live outside its own directory - see
# that Dockerfile's own comment). Without this, every service's
# node_modules/.next/build output gets swept into that context too,
# which is both slow and can fail outright on stray files (e.g. broken
# symlinks Next.js's file tracing can leave in .next/).
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
.git
